<title>SRI LANKA: New deputy head at John Keells.</title>
<headline>New deputy head at John Keells.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>John Keells Holdings Ltd has announced the appointment of a new deputy chairman, effective from January 1, a company release said.</p>
<p>Vivendra Lintotawela takes over as deputy chairman following the retirement of V. Kailasapillai, it said.</p>
<p>JKH, a blue chip, is the largest of the three conglomerates listed in Colombo.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
